name 'ai-generated-design-postassessment-q3_2025'

question 'A web designer asks an AI tool to create a homepage for a pet adoption center. The AI generates a page, but the layout is cluttered, and the contact information is missing. What is the most effective way for the designer to get a better result?'

wrong 'Keep the same short prompt but run it several more times.'
right 'Revise the prompt to include details about layout sections and the need for contact information.'
wrong 'Switch to a different AI tool without changing the request.'
wrong 'Add new photos to distract from the missing contact information.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lessons 3, 6, 10
MARKDOWN
